ount to purchase with Coinbase</li>\n<li>Specify Order status to set when payment is done</li>\n<li>Better User Experience</li>\n<li>Priority Support</li>\n<li>Easy Setup</li>\n<li>Better Redirections</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coderpress.co/products/coinbase-commerce-for-woocommerce/?utm_source=ccwc&amp;utm_medium=readme-become-pro-user\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Become Pro User👑</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
